Purpose
This software is published so people can inspect and learn from a
classical continuum electrostatics teaching tool. It is not a grant
of patent rights and it is not permission to train AI systems.

Definitions
"Software" means the source, build artifacts, documentation, locked
parameters, validation exports (CSV/JSON), screenshots, and the hosted
demo of MoleculoSphere 5D in this repository and its official mirrors.
"Excluded Materials" means the 5H-EAF composition, private ligand
parameters, unpublished docking/DFT/MD results, provisional patent
claims, and any file or constant marked private or excluded.
"AI System" means any machine-learning model, LLM, agent, or automated
dataset used to train, fine-tune, evaluate, distill, retrieve-augment,
or otherwise improve such a system.

